只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Antigravity plugin for DeepSeek Harness: smart multi-account quota rotation, multi-model LLM routing, and Nano Banana 2 image generation.","id":"gh:1375307195","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-tool-antigravity","slug":"Jaylor-Wang/dsh-tool-antigravity","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Antigravity plugin for DeepSeek Harness: smart multi-account quota rotation, multi-model LLM routing"},{"id":"p1s2","text":", and Nano Banana 2 image generation."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-tool-antigravity"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"High-performance, streamlined Antigravity capability bundle plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Provides private Google OAuth 2.0 PKCE authentication, smart multi-account pooling with seamless quo"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"ta failover, multi-model LLM routing (`google-antigravity`), session-persistent Nano Banana 2 image "},{"id":"p5s3","text":"generation and editing (`generate_image`, `list_images`), and an interactive Web settings panel with"},{"id":"p5s4","text":" live quota visualization."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Highlights in v0.5.3"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Normalize `anyOf` / `oneOf` Tool Schemas for Claude VALIDATED Mode (Fixes #12 / PR #13)**: Resol"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ved HTTP 400 `PROTOCOL_DRIFT` error on `antigravity-claude-opus-5-5` and `antigravity-claude-sonnet-"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"5-5` when tool definitions contain `anyOf` or `oneOf` unions (such as `generate_image.references.ite"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"ms`, DSH built-in `schedule_*`, `task_board_update`, or MCP tools).\n- **Claude Schema Normalization "},{"id":"p7s5","text":"& Discriminated Union Merging**: Pre-merges multi-branch `object` unions into unified schemas preser"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"ving all branch properties and discriminant keys, merges open string presets, and pipelines schemas "},{"id":"p7s7","text":"through `@cortexkit/antigravity-auth-core`'s `toGeminiSchema(..., { claudeValidated: true })`.\n- **A"},{"id":"p7s8","text":"ccurate Claude Tool Type Hints**: Lowercases type representations in `claudeToolTypeHint` so `STRICT"},{"id":"p7s9","text":" PARAMETERS:` system instructions emit clean type hints (e.g. `ARRAY_OF_OBJECTS[kind: string REQUIRE"},{"id":"p7s10","text":"D, handle: string, path: string]`) without `ARRAY_OF_UNKNOWN`."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### 1. High-Performance Core Architecture\n- **TLS Connection Pooling & Session Resumption**: Built-i"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"n HTTP/1.1 Keep-Alive socket pool and TLS session resumption against Google endpoints, eliminating r"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"epeated TLS handshake roundtrips and significantly reducing Time-To-First-Token (TTFT).\n- **Sliding-"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"Window Buffer SSE Parser**: High-throughput binary chunking directly locates newline separators on r"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"aw Buffers, bypassing heavy string concatenations and drastically reducing V8 heap allocations and G"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"C spikes during long reasoning chains.\n- **Granular Thinking Budgets**: Fine-grained reasoning effor"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"t configuration (`low`, `medium`, `high`) across Gemini and Claude models with graceful fallbacks.\n-"},{"id":"p9s8","text":" **Pre-flight Idempotent Retry**: Automatically retries transient network interruptions (e.g. TLS RS"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"T / 502 / 503 / 504) up to 3 times with exponential backoff prior to first byte emission.\n- **Window"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"s File Lock Recovery**: Active PID probing (`process.kill(pid, 0)`) detects stale locks from crashed"},{"id":"p9s11","text":" processes and immediately frees them, preventing 30-second hang timeouts.\n- **Stale-While-Revalidat"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"e (SWR) Quota Resilience**: Robust quota normalization supporting 5h and weekly windows; retains and"},{"id":"p9s13","text":" displays last-known valid quota with smooth shimmer animations during transient network disruptions"},{"id":"p9s14","text":"displays last-known valid quota with smooth shimmer animations during transient network disruptions."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### 2. Supported Models (`google-antigravity`)\n| Model Identifier | Display Name | Capabilities | Th"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"inking Budget |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `antigravity-gemini-4-argon` | Gemini 4 Argon | Text"},{"id":"p10s3","text":", Vision, Tools | Low / Medium / High |\n| `antigravity-gemini-3.8-flash` | Gemini 3.8 Flash | Text, "},{"id":"p10s4","text":"Vision, Tools | Low / Medium / High |\n| `antigravity-gemini-3.5-flash` | Gemini 3.5 Flash | Text, Vi"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"sion, Tools | Low / Medium / High |\n| `antigravity-claude-opus-5-5` | Claude Opus 5.5 | Text, Vision"},{"id":"p10s6","text":", Tools | Low / Medium / High |\n| `antigravity-claude-sonnet-5-5` | Claude Sonnet 5.5 | Text, Vision"},{"id":"p10s7","text":", Tools | Low / Medium / High |\n| `antigravity-gpt-oss-120b-medium` | GPT-OSS 120B Medium | Text, Vi"},{"id":"p10s8","text":"sion, Tools | Fixed Effort |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### 3. Nano Banana 2 Image Generation & Multi-Turn Editing\n- **`generate_image`**: Prompt-based imag"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"e creation and iterative image-to-image editing powered by Nano Banana 2 (`gemini-3.1-flash-image`) "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"using session references.\n- **`list_images`**: Inspect and retrieve generated image attachments with"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"in the current session.\n- Fully integrated with DSH `AttachmentStore` and `FileSystem` with TOCTOU p"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"ath escape protection without polluting chat context with raw base64 payloads."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Via DSH Plugin CLI (Recommended)"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### Via npm / pnpm"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Cordis Plugin Configuration\nAdd the plugin entries to your `cordis.patch.yml` or DSH config file"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"## Cordis Plugin Configuration\nAdd the plugin entries to your `cordis.patch.yml` or DSH config file:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Usage & Commands"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"### Slash Commands\nManage authentication directly from the DSH terminal / chat prompt:"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"- `/antigravity-auth login`: Initiates Google OAuth 2.0 PKCE login and launches your default browser"},{"id":"p21s2","text":".\n- `/antigravity-auth status`: Check current authentication state, masked email, and project id.\n- "},{"id":"p21s3","text":"`/antigravity-auth logout`: Discard credentials and revoke tokens.\n- `/antigravity-auth cancel`: Abo"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"rt an ongoing login attempt."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### UI Settings & Dashboard\nOnce loaded in the DSH Web client:\n- **Antigravity Auth Settings Card**:"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" View live login status, account identifier, and toggle capabilities.\n- **Quota Visualizer**: Real-t"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ime remaining quota percentages and countdowns for 5-hour and weekly reset windows.\n- **Image Genera"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"tion Card**: Configure default image models and batch size."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Security & Invariants"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"1. **Credential Isolation**: Access and refresh tokens are strictly held in host-side secure stores "},{"id":"p24s2","text":"and are never forwarded to the frontend UI, logs, or command done events.\n2. **Strict Loopback Guard"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"**: Account RPC endpoints fail-closed (`loopback-required`) unless the web service is explicitly bou"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"nd to `127.0.0.1`.\n3. **Immutable Wire Identity**: Emits verified AGY CLI headers (`antigravity/cli/"},{"id":"p24s5","text":"1.1.24`) and attribution metadata.\n4. **Media Path Containment**: All file references are verified a"},{"id":"p24s6","text":"gainst directory traversal and symlink escapes."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Disclaimer"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"This project is an unofficial, community-driven capability bundle intended strictly for personal res"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"earch, educational purposes, and independent development. Please adhere to relevant platform Terms o"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"cational purposes, and independent development. Please adhere to relevant platform Terms of Service."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"MIT © dsh-tool-antigravity contributors"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
